  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



11. scopeQ=(/Madrid/%23;/CompanyA) - '/#' inside parentheses, outside the grammar but accepted: E3
================================================================================================
    "id": "urn:ngsi-ld:Z:E3",


12. POST /entityOperations/query, scopeQ (/Madrid/Districts;/CompanyA): E3
==========================================================================
    "id": "urn:ngsi-ld:Z:E3",


13. POST /entityOperations/query, scopeQ /Madrid; - ends in an operator: 400
============================================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 182

{
  "detail": "an AND of Scopes needs parentheses: (/A;/B)",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Invalid scopeQ parameter",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



14. Create a subscription with scopeQ /Madrid/#/Gardens: 400
============================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 184

{
  "detail": "'#' only as the last level of a Scope: '/A/#'",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Invalid scopeQ parameter",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



--TEARDOWN--
coraineStop
corDbDrop
